DESCRIPTION:Block Leader Social All Block Leaders and Co-Leaders are invit
 ed to join us for refreshments and inspiration as we share ideas and the l
 essons learned along the way. Whether you've finished the program or have 
 not started yet\, this is a chance to enjoy connecting with fellow team le
 aders. Even if you haven't walked your block&nbsp\;or hosted your first me
 eting\, we'd love to see you there! You can swap ideas for neighborhood me
 etings\, discuss what worked (and what didn't)\, brainstorm solutions to c
 ommon roadblocks\, and celebrate successes. This is a fun&nbsp\;space to a
 sk questions\, gain inspiration\, and build relationships with fellow team
  leaders. Please RSVP so we know how many people to plan for\, and bring y
 our co-leaders! #block-d23153a7ca83d8cacfe8 { --stroke-style: none\;--stro
