 )\; } Introducing a Special Transit Edition of the Cool Book Club Calling 
 all transit wonks and Clipper Card newbies: grab a drink and join the conv
 ersation to celebrate Transit Month. Cool Books has a transit theme in Sep
 tember: we'll be talking through big ideas about how our streets\, roads\,
  and transit systems shape daily life\, inspired by Confessions of a Recov
 ering Engineer: Transportation for a Strong Town . Skimmed the book\, read
  the whole thing\, or are just curious? All are welcome! Want to take the 
 next step to see how these ideas show up locally in real life? Save the da
 te for Friday\, September 4th at 11:00 AM for Read and Ride . We’ll ride
  the Route 11 bus together with Petaluma Transit Division Manager\, Maria 
 Arce\, to enjoy the view and keep the conversation going. #block-yui_3_17_
